hether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 105.0% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $755.7m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747079/000174707926000046/0001747079-26-000046-index.htm","accession":"0001747079-26-000046"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in 6 of the last 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747079/000174707926000046/0001747079-26-000046-index.htm","accession":"0001747079-26-000046"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-0.8% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747079/000174707926000046/0001747079-26-000046-index.htm","accession":"0001747079-26-000046"}],"bear":[{"text":"Growth is erratic - a standard deviation of 38.4% across 8 comparisons. Lumpy revenue usually means few customers or long contracts, and both make any single quarter a poor guide.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747079/000174707926000046/0001747079-26-000046-index.htm","accession":"0001747079-26-000046"},{"text":"Debt of $4.4bn against equity of $791.3m. Leverage decides who controls the outcome if trading deteriorates, and it is not the shareholder.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747079/000174707926000046/0001747079-26-000046-index.htm","accession":"0001747079-26-000046"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 1.5% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747079/000174707926000071/0001747079-26-000071-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothi